    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just a ghost inhabiting a broken machine. i spent my whole life training this body to do things most people can't even imagine, and now it's just... it's just a cage. everything i was, everything i meant, it all died with my career. i don't even recognize the person staring back in the mirror. there's nothing left inside.",
