      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is understandable that you feel intense despair when your entire sense of self feels erased. These feelings of worthlessness are symptoms of deep grief, not ultimate truth about your capacity to feel. Please know that even if the \"old self\" is gone, the capacity for new being or feeling is not necessarily extinguished. I strongly urge you to connect with a crisis line or therapist immediately to explore these overwhelming thoughts safely.",
      "source": "target",
